./LOGBOOK.md:925:- VERIFICATION: Reviewer independently re-checked spec quotes (relay-protocol.md:110-113, security-privacy.md:59-66), HEV pinned-source bounds (`UDP_BUF_SIZE 1500` at hev-socks5-udp.c:26; stream-fatal `datlen > len − addrlen` at :203-206; `msgv[i].len = UDP_BUF_SIZE` in session-udp fwd_b → 1472 ≤ 1481 worst-case IPv6, reply write 1491 ≤ 1500 by construction), frame arithmetic (max legal body 1733 < floor 2048), reserved bit/type-range vacancy in the frozen binding, all 13 downstream ID-scoped notes, ADR-021 number vacancy, and diagram artifacts. No product code modified; `task-board validate` clean. Evidence: `.task-board/.resources/TASK-260715-18owh7/TASK-260715-18owh7_review.md`.
